  "introduction": {
    "overview": "This is a revision sheet in text form. Each entry gives the formula, when to use it and a small worked check so that you can verify that you remember it correctly. The set covers percentages, profit and loss, ratio, averages, interest, time and work, time and distance, mixtures, permutations and combinations, and geometry. The best use of a quick reference is to cover the right-hand side and reproduce it from memory.",
